1
00:00:04,554 --> 00:00:06,004
(Howard:)Are you crazy?

2
00:00:06,156 --> 00:00:09,136
(Howard:)You don't want
your girlfriend at work with you.

3
00:00:09,292 --> 00:00:10,892
(Howard:)Hell Clam.

4
00:00:11,995 --> 00:00:13,035
(Sheldon:)Why not?

5
00:00:13,196 --> 00:00:15,176
(Sheldon:)Hairy Fairy.

6
00:00:15,999 --> 00:00:17,479
(Raj:)I think it could be romantic.

7
00:00:17,634 --> 00:00:19,414
(Raj:)You know, my parents met
at his place of work.

8
00:00:19,503 --> 00:00:22,503
Your father's a gynecologist.

9
00:00:22,572 --> 00:00:26,522
(Raj:)I know. What started as a pap smear
turned into a date.

10
00:00:28,078 --> 00:00:29,888
(Raj:)Which turned into her working there,
which turned into marriage,

11
00:00:30,047 --> 00:00:33,327
(Raj:)which then turned into hatred,
which continues to this day.

12
00:00:34,084 --> 00:00:36,324
(Raj:)Two-Eyed Cyclops.

13
00:00:37,220 --> 00:00:39,220
(Howard:)Would you please tell him
this isn't a good idea?

14
00:00:39,389 --> 00:00:40,729
(Leonard:)No. I think it'll be great.

15
00:00:40,891 --> 00:00:42,601
(Leonard:)Maybe next time he gets
conjunctivitis at work,

16
00:00:42,759 --> 00:00:45,209
(Leonard:)she can hold his head and try to put
the drops in his eyes.

17
00:00:46,430 --> 00:00:48,930
(Leonard:)Giant baby.

18
00:00:49,266 --> 00:00:51,006
(Sheldon:)That's a Raging Ogre.

19
00:00:51,068 --> 00:00:52,908
(Raj:)I know.

20
00:00:55,205 --> 00:00:57,205
(Howard:)I'm just saying, I'd never want
to work with Bernadette.

21
00:00:57,374 --> 00:00:59,944
(Howard:)Can you imagine seeing
someone all day long

22
00:01:00,110 --> 00:01:02,590
(Howard:)and then you're supposed to hang out
with them after work, too?

